---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";

import PhotoStrip from "../components/PhotoStrip.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="site-section">
    <div class="regular-paragraph">
      <h1>Photography</h1>
      <p>
        I got my first camera in December before my big around the world trip
        for an unknown amount of time. I went and still going through a
        journey of exploration of photography and photo treatment. Software
        editing, photo printing, and zine designing.
      </p>
    </div>
    <PhotoStrip />
  </div>

  <div class="site-section">
    <div class="regular-paragraph">
      <h1>YouTube</h1>
      <p>
        I do a lot of experiments on YouTube, I would say video is an art form
        I feel very free and uncommitted to doing stuff a certain way. You
        will see a pretty wide variety of content from a 9th birthday
        electronic song to a hitchhiking in Japan vlog.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="video-container">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/3NQxxfJ3r6Q"
        title="YouTube video player"
        frameborder="0"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>